(7611197, 1231688, 99263, '<td valign="top">Pity about the distracting line of a door and door hinge on the left. It would have been better if you had eliminated that line by cropping your photo just on the inside of that line and instead of chopping of part of the boys head on the right, had not done so, but had included the boys entire head and face in the frame. I would have also cropped of about a 1/2 centimeter from the bottom so just eliminating that other distracting little line in the bottom right hand corner. <br/>Otherwise good subject with nice lighting and processing.</td>', 'Pity about the distracting line of a door and door hinge on the left. It would have been better if you had eliminated that line by cropping your photo just on the inside of that line and instead of chopping of part of the boys head on the right, had not done so, but had included the boys entire head and face in the frame. I would have also cropped of about a 1/2 centimeter from the bottom so just eliminating that other distracting little line in the bottom right hand corner. Otherwise good subject with nice lighting and processing.', '2019-01-30 05:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
