(7611217, 1231688, 16216, '<td valign="top">Nice try at rembrandt lighting,  Your Shadows (histogram Left)  and Highlights (histogram Right)  are both to the extremes and you lose details in both. I would also would have recomposed to get the Door hinge out of the picture and bring in the left side, your right side of his face.</td>', 'Nice try at rembrandt lighting,  Your Shadows (histogram Left)  and Highlights (histogram Right)  are both to the extremes and you lose details in both. I would also would have recomposed to get the Door hinge out of the picture and bring in the left side, your right side of his face.', '2019-01-30 08:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611218, 1231579, 16216, '<td valign="top">So Young So Innocent but those Eyes have stories to tell. Nice work</td>', 'So Young So Innocent but those Eyes have stories to tell. Nice work', '2019-01-30 08:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611219, 1231359, 16216, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I would have liked to see it close up, this guy has some  great facial features.</td>', 'Nice capture, I would have liked to see it close up, this guy has some  great facial features.', '2019-01-30 08:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611220, 1231459, 16216, '<td valign="top">I am an ex smoker and cigarettes are my enemy, However this picture says a lot, Here stone face shows all the trials and tribulations she has been through and that cigarette show how she has managed. Nice capture</td>', 'I am an ex smoker and cigarettes are my enemy, However this picture says a lot, Here stone face shows all the trials and tribulations she has been through and that cigarette show how she has managed. Nice capture', '2019-01-30 08:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611221, 1231319, 16216, '<td valign="top">Very Grainy. I do not like the composition either it almost seems as if the main subject is the Sign and you threw the face in there as an after thought.  Use the rules of thirds and fill the frame more</td>', 'Very Grainy. I do not like the composition either it almost seems as if the main subject is the Sign and you threw the face in there as an after thought.  Use the rules of thirds and fill the frame more', '2019-01-30 08:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611222, 1231155, 16216, '<td valign="top">IMHO I do not like the High Key look, and Over processing of the eyes, Sometimes Less is more.</td>', 'IMHO I do not like the High Key look, and Over processing of the eyes, Sometimes Less is more.', '2019-01-30 08:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611234, 1231810, 124815, '<td valign="top">A soulful Penny in a lovely light</td>', 'A soulful Penny in a lovely light', '2019-01-30 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611235, 1231755, 124815, '<td valign="top">I know this smile!</td>', 'I know this smile!', '2019-01-30 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611316, 1231514, 16216, '<td valign="top">Noah is a good looking young man the picture taken well, it looks like you had your camera lens set to its lowest aperture, this is evident by the shallow depth of field. The key on facials is to make sure that the focal point is always in the eye so that the eye is crisp and 100 percent in focus, The eyes here are a bit soft</td>', 'Noah is a good looking young man the picture taken well, it looks like you had your camera lens set to its lowest aperture, this is evident by the shallow depth of field. The key on facials is to make sure that the focal point is always in the eye so that the eye is crisp and 100 percent in focus, The eyes here are a bit soft', '2019-01-30 23:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611317, 1231776, 16216, '<td valign="top">Wow!  this one POPS out at you. Here Eyes are ULTRA sharp however with all the Blurring you did to the skin she looks like she has plastic skin. Sorry too over processed for my taste. It''s a same this is a really nice picture</td>', 'Wow!  this one POPS out at you. Here Eyes are ULTRA sharp however with all the Blurring you did to the skin she looks like she has plastic skin. Sorry too over processed for my taste. It''s a same this is a really nice picture', '2019-01-30 23:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
